  Instructions:
  - Look at the number on the launch screen.
  - Keep your eyes on the number. This box shows where the eye tracker thinks you
    are looking.
  - The instructions will tell  you to move your head up and down or side to side.
    Keep your gaze on the number on the screen!
  - If you keep your gaze steady on the screen the numbers will change. Say each
    number out loud as you see it!
  - Keep going to power the rocket. You'll see this progress bar fill up as you go.
  - When the progress bar is full, get ready to blast off!
  InstructionText: {fileID: 399983192}
